{
  "schemaVersion": "story-package-beat-module/0.1",
  "package": {
    "id": "taixu-relics-part1",
    "version": "0.1.3"
  },
  "chapter": {
    "id": "chapter-030",
    "title": "城中最后一夜"
  },
  "beat": {
    "id": "beat_chapter_170",
    "nodeId": "node_source_continuity",
    "summary": "陆沉舟在街尾修好一盏破灯，交给一个失明的老人。",
    "narrativeBrief": [
      {
        "text": "封天令落下后的第一夜，陆照临梦见一场没有尽头的雨。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-001",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5245,
          "end": 5245
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "梦里他只有七岁，站在北河城老槐树下。雨水从树冠落下，像无数条透明的线。陆沉舟蹲在他面前，手里握着一盏空灯。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-002",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5247,
          "end": 5247
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“第三盏灯为什么没有火？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-003",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5249,
          "end": 5249
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“因为火会照见不该照见的人。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-004",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5251,
          "end": 5251
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那它怎么走路？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-005",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5253,
          "end": 5253
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“灯不走路，拿灯的人走。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-006",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5255,
          "end": 5255
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临伸手去摸灯柄，掌心传来灼热。梦境随即变暗，树后的屋门被人推开，沈砚秋提着青色灯火走出来。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-007",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5257,
          "end": 5257
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“陆沉舟，时间到了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-008",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5259,
          "end": 5259
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟没有回头：“他还太小。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-009",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5261,
          "end": 5261
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“太虚遗脉不会等他长大。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-010",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5263,
          "end": 5263
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就把我留下。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-011",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5265,
          "end": 5265
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你已经留下了一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-012",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5267,
          "end": 5267
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "沈砚秋抬起灯。灯火照在年幼的陆照临胸口，那里浮出一道半枚残印。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-013",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5269,
          "end": 5269
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临惊醒时，掌心冷得像雪。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-014",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5271,
          "end": 5271
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离坐在火堆旁，手里捧着第二盏灯的残罩。她一夜没有睡，债契黑纹已经爬到颈侧。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-015",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5273,
          "end": 5273
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你梦见什么？”她问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-016",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5275,
          "end": 5275
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我父亲把残印放进了我体内。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-017",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5277,
          "end": 5277
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你以前不知道？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-018",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5279,
          "end": 5279
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我只记得他教我修灯。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-019",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5281,
          "end": 5281
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜从洞口回来：“回川城的记忆开始混乱。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-020",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5283,
          "end": 5283
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“提前了两天。”顾长离说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-021",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5285,
          "end": 5285
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“封天令只是延后，不是停止。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-022",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5287,
          "end": 5287
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "叶观澜摊开地图。地图上回川城的位置被青光包围，城中数百盏灯的标记正在互相交换。原本写着“东门”的灯，移动到了城心；原本写着“城心”的灯，则出现在城外。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-023",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5289,
          "end": 5289
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“有人在改地图。”陆照临说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-024",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5291,
          "end": 5291
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不是人。”叶观澜回答，“是城里的人开始记错自己住在哪里。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-025",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5293,
          "end": 5293
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "他们赶到回川城时，城门已经半开。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-026",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5295,
          "end": 5295
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "守门老人站在门洞里，手里握着一盏长明灯。他看见陆照临，立刻问：“你是从东门进来的，还是从西门出去的？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-027",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5297,
          "end": 5297
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我们还没进城。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-028",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5299,
          "end": 5299
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "老人点头：“那你们已经出去过一次。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-029",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5301,
          "end": 5301
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离看向城内。街道上的行人神情茫然，有人站在自家门前，却认不出门上的字；有人抱着孩子，反复问孩子叫什么。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-030",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5303,
          "end": 5303
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“记忆错乱已经扩散。”慧闻从城墙上跃下。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-031",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5305,
          "end": 5305
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你什么时候到的？”陆照临问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-032",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5307,
          "end": 5307
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“在你们决定来之前。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-033",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5309,
          "end": 5309
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你看见城心了吗？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-034",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5311,
          "end": 5311
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“看见了。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-035",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5313,
          "end": 5313
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻指向城中最高的钟楼。钟楼上悬着三盏灯，第一盏和第二盏已经点亮，第三盏仍然熄灭。每当钟声响起一次，城里便有一批人忘记自己的住处。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-036",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5315,
          "end": 5315
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“必须熄灭前两盏？”顾长离问。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-037",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5317,
          "end": 5317
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“不能。它们是封天令的锚。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-038",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5319,
          "end": 5319
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那就点第三盏。”叶观澜说。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-039",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5321,
          "end": 5321
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“点亮第三盏，城门会完全开启。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-040",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5323,
          "end": 5323
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临看向钟楼：“封天令说三日后开门，为什么现在已经有两盏亮了？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-041",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5325,
          "end": 5325
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "慧闻答：“因为持印者的记忆正在替它倒计时。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-042",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5327,
          "end": 5327
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临摸向胸口。半枚残印的青光沿经脉流动，气海里的金色裂纹比昨日更明显。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-043",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5329,
          "end": 5329
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“我忘了什么？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-044",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5331,
          "end": 5331
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“你自己知道。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-045",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5333,
          "end": 5333
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临试着回忆七岁那场雨。槐树、空灯、沈砚秋，他都记得。唯独陆沉舟最后说了什么，始终想不起。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-046",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5335,
          "end": 5335
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "顾长离把铜针递给他：“看针尾。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-047",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5337,
          "end": 5337
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "针尾缺口朝向城心。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-048",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5339,
          "end": 5339
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“那里有答案？”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-049",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5341,
          "end": 5341
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城内忽然传来哭喊。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-051",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5345,
          "end": 5345
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临将无名小灯按在钟楼石面上。小灯没有火，却在石面刻出一道新的裂缝。裂缝沿钟楼向下，穿过城心，最终停在封天令的空白处。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-089",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5621,
          "end": 5621
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "空白处浮出一行字：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-090",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5623,
          "end": 5623
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“三日已满，选择归还。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-091",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5625,
          "end": 5625
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "回川城所有人的目光同时转向陆照临。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-092",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5627,
          "end": 5627
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "有人记得自己，有人只记得别人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-093",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5629,
          "end": 5629
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第三盏灯在天门下发出一声敲击。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-094",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5631,
          "end": 5631
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆沉舟的声音从城市每一盏灯里传来：",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-095",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5633,
          "end": 5633
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "“照临，今晚之后，门会记住你。”",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-096",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5635,
          "end": 5635
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "天门裂缝缓缓扩大。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-097",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5637,
          "end": 5637
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "第一声天门鸣响，震碎了回川城最后一块没有名字的石碑。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-098",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5639,
          "end": 5639
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "陆照临站在裂缝中央，忽然明白所谓“归还”并不是把名字交回原主，而是让所有人重新承担记忆带来的痛苦。城外的雪光照进来，照亮顾长离陌生又熟悉的脸。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-099",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5641,
          "end": 5641
        }
      },
      {
        "text": "城中最后一夜，家家户户把灯搬到街上。有人想送行，有人想看守，也有人只想确认陆照临是否真的存在。陆沉舟在街尾修好一盏破灯，交给一个失明的老人。",
        "evidenceParagraphId": "paragraph-100",
        "lineRange": {
          "start": 5643,
          "end": 5643
        }
      }
    ],
